{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START FROM NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your old life behind and arrive at Pionero Island with nothing but pure ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, one of your old contacts gives you a head start to build your own business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESELL IMPORTED PRODUCTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the port to buy imported goods, package them with your company's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >name and resell for twice the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCALE YOUR PRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, build a delivery fleet, and scale your online presence with servers and targeted marketing. Make the business work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY YOUR MONEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your money to buy cars, personal properties, clothing and fund your lifestyle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275210?t=1771897122","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275210?t=1771897122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/799b5536ef74ce58524ec3ca5948a047ef359f47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771897122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/799b5536ef74ce58524ec3ca5948a047ef359f47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771897122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4228490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/extras/f8f2934c8063be9f8c236cb249936751.avif?t=1771897122\" width=780 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START FROM NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your old life behind and arrive at Pionero Island with nothing but pure ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, one of your old contacts gives you a head start to build your own business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESELL IMPORTED PRODUCTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the port to buy imported goods, package them with your company's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >name and resell for twice the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCALE YOUR PRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, build a delivery fleet, and scale your online presence with servers and targeted marketing. Make the business work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY YOUR MONEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your money to buy cars, personal properties, clothing and fund your lifestyle.</p>","developers":["Pionero Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275210/97a78b08ed47607fa08880a838426a38aecbe12e/header.jpg?t=1771897122","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3275210/1601646738/dd5963e4ed8fa009b70bdf176bdf0e0ac43a5669/1771870909/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771873168","dash_h264"